From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:38:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 152/159] arm64: dts: qcom: nairo: Enable the ADSP and CDSP

Enable the audio and compute DSPs with their firmware.

The downstream adsp-loader picks the ADSP image from the adsp_variant
fuse; on this phone that is adsp2.mdt, adsp.mdt never starts.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts | 14 ++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 14 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts
index 6845c11b1be3..bd1b90463e12 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm7250-motorola-nairo.dts
@@ -551,6 +551,20 @@ &pon_resin {
 	status = "okay";
 };
 
+&remoteproc_adsp {
+	/*
+	 * Downstream's adsp-loader picks the image from the adsp_variant fuse;
+	 * on this phone that is adsp2 (adsp.mdt never starts).
+	 */
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm7250/motorola/nairo/adsp2.mdt";
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
+&remoteproc_cdsp {
+	firmware-name = "qcom/sm7250/motorola/nairo/cdsp.mdt";
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &remoteproc_mpss {
 	firmware-name = "qcom/sm7250/motorola/nairo/modem.mdt";
 	status = "okay";
